# ThreadSanitizer suppressions for `just tsan`. A line needs a comment naming the false
# positive it hides; a real race gets fixed, never listed here.

# Segment::release frees the segment after `fetch_sub(Release)` and `fence(Acquire)`, the
# standard refcount idiom. ThreadSanitizer does not model `atomic_thread_fence`, so it
# sees the free as unordered with the other owners' last accesses.
race:Segment*release
